1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:18,649
Have you ever wondered how Vande Bharat reaches its top speed in just a few minutes?

2
00:00:18,750 --> 00:00:37,399
Its speed keeps increasing every second — that is acceleration! Velocity tells us how fast and in which direction the train moves.

3
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:56,149
For uniform acceleration we use equations like average acceleration equals delta v over delta t. Distance, velocity, time — all linked on a straight line journey!

4
00:00:56,250 --> 00:01:14,900
